    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -680,
        "y": -300
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Semantic segmentation labels every pixel. SyntheticSegmentation draws circles and rectangles on 32x32 images and gives a mask with class 0 (background), 1 (circle) or 2 (rectangle) per pixel. The model outputs 3 scores per pixel, CrossEntropyLoss compares them with the mask, and EvaluateModel reports the fraction of pixels labelled correctly on 100 images it never trained on. About 89% of the pixels are background, so a model that answers background everywhere scores 0.89; this one scores about 0.96 after 8 epochs.\n\n語意分割要替每個像素標上類別。SyntheticSegmentation 會在 32x32 的影像上畫圓形和矩形，並給出每個像素的遮罩：0 是背景、1 是圓形、2 是矩形。模型對每個像素輸出 3 個分數，CrossEntropyLoss 拿它們和遮罩比對，EvaluateModel 則回報在 100 張沒訓練過的影像上，標對的像素比例。約 89% 的像素是背景，所以全部回答背景的模型就有 0.89；這個模型訓練 8 個 epoch 後約為 0.96。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-model",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 620
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Encoder-decoder in the layer editor: two 3x3 convolutions with a 2x2 max-pool between them halve the resolution, a stride-2 ConvTranspose2d restores it, and a 1x1 convolution maps 16 channels to 3 class scores per pixel.\n\n圖層編輯器裡是編碼器-解碼器：兩層 3x3 卷積之間夾一個 2x2 max-pool，把解析度減半；stride 2 的 ConvTranspose2d 再把解析度還原；最後用 1x1 卷積把 16 個通道轉成每個像素 3 個類別分數。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "model",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 200
        },
        "noteWidth": 280
      }
    }
